invalid type: string "16.1 Employee Offboarding and Exit Interview\nWhen an employment separation date is finalized:\n\u{7f} Exit Interview: People Operations conducts a formal exit interview to collect feedback on company culture,\nmanagerial effectiveness, and operational bottlenecks. Participation is optional but strongly encouraged.\n\u{7f}en response within five (5) days.\ner-office\nvisits\n